     AppIcon: full-colour Liquid-Glass app icon as DrawingImage, design box 0,0,256,256.
     Each glyph viewport contributes exact 0..24 bounds without painting: its segment is
     IsStroked=False and its figure IsFilled=False. Visible strokes stay inside the box.
     Stretch=Uniform therefore cannot independently enlarge narrow glyphs such as Check.
     Original drawings inspired by symbol conventions; no Apple artwork is redistributed. -->
